{"message":"Yes—assuming she does not need international banking features, Lime Green is the stronger referral choice if your priority is maximizing your bonus. You would earn $200 after she deposits at least $15,000 within 90 days.

However, Sky Blue may be a better account fit because it is specifically designed for startups formed within four years. It would earn you $150 and requires a $10,000 deposit within 90 days. If the current startup-account promotion applies, Sky Blue is prioritized when it meets the business’s needs.

So my practical recommendation is: choose Lime Green for the larger bonus, provided its business-account features suit her LLC; choose Sky Blue if startup-specific features and the six-month fee-free period matter more."}
